    "description": "MITRA Group, Inc. engages in transaction support in the fields of transaction procedures and settlements related to finance, real estate, and construction in Japan. The company operates in three segments: Escrow Services, BPO, and Real Estate Auctions. It also offers business process outsourcing (BPO) service business consisting of business consignment and temporary staffing services; and escrow services comprising various support services, including information system provision for real estate businesses, financial institutions, construction businesses, and general customers. In addition, the company provides construction and development design services; business support services for professionals; and various consulting services for construction companies. Further, it offers escrow account services, trust services and inheritance procedure agency services, registration information acquisition filing system. The company was formerly known as Escrow Agent Japan, Inc. and changed its name to MITRA Group, Inc. in June 2026. The company was founded in 1982 and is headquartered in Tokyo, Japan."
